懒人作者页代码来自&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/w-asriel&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3317001&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1610092696&quot; alt=&quot;W Asriel&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3317001)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/w-asriel&quot;  &gt;W Asriel&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;，感谢！&lt;/p&gt;
