n></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/outrunscp.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="outrunscp.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>超跃SCP壁纸</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/chaosoutrun.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="chaosoutrun.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>超跃混沌分裂者壁纸</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/ntfoutrun.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="ntfoutrun.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>超跃九尾狐壁纸</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/mazhattersoutrun.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="mazhattersoutrun.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>超跃疯帽商壁纸</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wdfiles.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/outrunscp%20phone.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="outrunscp%20phone.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>超跃SCP超跃壁纸</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><span style="font-size:xx-large;"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">霓虹&nbsp;壁纸</a></span></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><span style="font-size:xx-large;"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">纸壁&nbsp;虹霓</a></span></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/neon%20scp%204k%20original.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="neon%20scp%204k%20original.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>SCP霓虹壁纸</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/173%20edit.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="173%20edit.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>SCP-173 霓虹壁纸</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/chaos.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="chaos.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>混沌分裂者 霓虹壁纸</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/ntf.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="ntf.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>九尾狐 霓虹壁纸</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/Gamers%20against%20weed.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="Gamers%20against%20weed.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>反大麻玩家 霓虹壁纸</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/o035.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="o035.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>SCP-035 霓虹壁纸</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/goc.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="goc.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>GOC 霓虹壁纸</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/serpent.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="serpent.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>蛇之手 霓虹壁纸</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wdfiles.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/cotbg%20broken%20church.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="cotbg%20broken%20church.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>破碎之神教会 霓虹壁纸</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wdfiles.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/phone%20neon%20scp.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="phone%20neon%20scp.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>SCP 霓虹壁纸-移动端</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><span style="font-size:xx-large;"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">其它风格的壁纸</a></span></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><span style="font-size:xx-large;"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">纸壁的格风它其</a></span></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wdfiles.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/SCP%20Cube%20wallpaper.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="SCP%20Cube%20wallpaper.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>SCP 方块</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wdfiles.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/SCP%20Retro%2080s.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="SCP%20Retro%2080s.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>80年代复古风格</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wdfiles.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/SCP%2080s%20Triangle.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="SCP%2080s%20Triangle.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>80年代三角风格</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wdfiles.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/scp%20glitch.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="scp%20glitch.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>浮华 风格</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/SCP%20retro.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="SCP%20retro.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>复古风格 1</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/scp%20retro%20wallpaper%202.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="scp%20retro%20wallpaper%202.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>复古风格 2</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/SCP%20red.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="SCP%20red.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>红色计划</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wdfiles.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/SCP%20windows%2095.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="SCP%20windows%2095.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>复古电脑风格</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:550px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wdfiles.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/SCP%20Red%20typhography%20PC.jpg" style="width:550px;" alt="SCP%20Red%20typhography%20PC.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:550px;"> <p>红色风暴警戒</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> <p>我也有关于SCP的<a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCAl6tAt8-IjQTW-tHn0fRnA">Youtube 频道</a><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /></p> <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">关于我的页面吉祥物</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">关于我的页面吉祥物</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:250px;"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wdfiles.com/local--files/ananomalouswriter/scp.png" style="width:250px;" alt="scp.png" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:250px;"> <p>吉祥物</p> </div> </div> <p><span style="font-size:large;"><br /> 页面吉祥物是在 <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/luxkeeper" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6847322&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610092697" alt="Luxkeeper" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6847322)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/luxkeeper" >Luxkeeper</a></span>的帮助下完成的。 看看他优秀的<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/luxkeeper-s-artpage">艺作页</a> :)<br /></span></p> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-fishbone" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6127045&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610092697" alt="Dr Fishbone" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6127045)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-fishbone" >Dr Fishbone</a></span></p> 
