81%9D%E3%81%86%E3%81%95%E3%81%8F.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>创作学徒</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布5篇以上的SCP文档</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%81%8A%E7%A5%AD%E3%82%8A%E5%A5%BD%E3%81%8D.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%81%8A%E7%A5%AD%E3%82%8A%E5%A5%BD%E3%81%8D.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>喜欢祭典</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>参加一次竞赛</strong></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong><em>首次：<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/gallery-writing">2020画廊大赛</a></em></strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%AD%A6%E8%80%85.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%AD%A6%E8%80%85.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>生物学家</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分20以上的、包含下列任一标签的SCP文档：生物性、活物、基因、动物、植物、细菌</strong></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong><em>首篇：<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1143">SCP-CN-1143</a></em></strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%BF%83%E7%90%86%E5%AD%A6%E8%80%85.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%BF%83%E7%90%86%E5%AD%A6%E8%80%85.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>心理学家</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:75%;"><strong>发布一篇评分20以上的、包含下列任一标签的SCP文档：精神影响、