?userid=5001379&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610092697" alt="Morphie" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5001379)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/morphie" >Morphie</a></span> 绘制的Kcorena，内含1184、1143、1132以及还没写出来的一篇的要素。由Morphie手绘，然后由我在sketchbook里描图、在ai里转为矢量图并做阴影。看到手绘照片的瞬间我就爽大发了。</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;显示</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;隐藏</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:100%; height:100%"><img src="https://i.loli.net/2020/06/08/SVIipjKrwxs2TEu.png" style="width: 100%; height: 100%;" class="enlarge" alt="SVIipjKrwxs2TEu.png" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width: 100%;"> <p>再次感谢Morphie！</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;隐藏</a></div> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div style="color:#003366;margin:0 auto;padding: 1px 15px; background-color:#fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <p>由<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/breaddddd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3471238&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610092697" alt="breaddddd" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3471238)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/breaddddd" >breaddddd</a></span> 绘制的 Kcorena</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;显示</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;