国</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/foundation-of-the-empire">立國之本</a></strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mscarlet" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1745583&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610092697" alt="MScarlet" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1745583)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mscarlet" >MScarlet</a></span></li> <li><em>国家的建立一般都伴随着一个个可歌可泣的故事；但这个国家的建立，卻是从一件玩具开始的。</em></li> </ul> <p>10. <strong>逆模因</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/antimeme-guide">简单易懂的逆模因识别指南（节选）</a></strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/timeelapsed" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3662783&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610092697" alt="TimeElapsed" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3662783)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/timeelapsed" >TimeElapsed</a></span></li> <li><em>相信我，你不会想，也不会知道作者的下场是怎样的。</em></li> </ul> <p>11. <strong>超形上学</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/veleafer-s-proposal">SCP-CN-001：Veleafer的提案-演绎部</a></strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veleafer" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2934041&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610092697" alt="Veleafer" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2934041)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veleafer" >Veleafer</a></span></li> <li><em>将会有一场RK级叙事崩毁，我们的作者，某个更上叙事的人把我们的叙事线打了一个结，想看好戏。</em></li> </ul> <p>12. <strong>圣诞节</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/merry-freakmas">圣诞快乐</a></strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/forgotmydrug" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4313927&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610092697" alt="ForgotMyDrug" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4313927)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/forgotmydrug" >ForgotMyDrug</a></span></li> <li><em>在圣诞节的夜里，小乔治渡过了一個难忘的晚上。</em></li> </ul> <p>13. <strong>新年</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/new-year-bell">新年钟声 暨 Dr.Marleak是怎样收容跨年晚会的</a></strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/simon-arran" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4354147&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610092697" alt="Simon Arran" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4354147)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/simon-arran" >Simon Arran</a></span></li> <li><em>随着Duang的一声，基金会又平安踏进新的一年，Ramen。</em></li> </ul> <p>14. <strong>科幻</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/kill-the-world">K-96时停对策雷</a></strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/bitchangelover" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2995593&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610092697" alt="bitchangelover" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2995593)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/bitchangelover" >bitchangelover</a></span></li> <li><em>要对付世上最难缠的时停能力持有者，你需要简单管用的理论、将理论化为现实的手段、以及必要的牺牲。</em></li> </ul> <p>15. <strong>因果</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1485">SCP-CN-1485</a></strong> - 将尔晦明，彼凭一叩 by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5480202&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610092697" alt="sciencekiller" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5480202)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" >sciencekiller</a></span></li> <li><em>记住，别像我们一样带入外来物。</em></li> </ul> <p>16. <strong>Bright博士</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/jack-bright-resting-at-last">Jack Bright在此安息</a></strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lyrics-linn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3935168&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610092697" alt="Lyrics Linn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3935168)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lyrics-linn" >Lyrics Linn</a></span></li> <li><em>每说一声再见，就是死去一点。——《漫长的告别》</em></li> </ul> <p>17. <strong>北欧神话</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1143">SCP-CN-1143</a></strong> - 北欧的终结 by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kcorena" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3396110&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610092697" alt="Kcorena" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3396110)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kcorena" >Kcorena</a></span></li> <li><em>“只要那孩子还立在大地上，他就是不败的”</em></li> </ul> <p>18. <strong>赛博朋克</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/neur0mancer">亚伯拉罕末班车</a></strong> by (account deleted)</li> <li>“<em>你真他妈是一疯狗，畜生。”第十三个妓女尸体躺在地上，话还未说完就跟着腹部流出来肠子昏歇。</em>”</li> </ul> <p>19. <strong>演化</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1868">SCP-CN-1868</a></strong> - 自知之明 by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-zhengshi" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5288378&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610092697" alt="Dr Zhengshi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5288378)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-zhengshi" >Dr Zhengshi</a></span></li> <li><em>演化之路永无止境，我们同样不曾奢望自己已经无需超越自己，便能行至尽头。</em></li> </ul> <p>20. <strong>武术</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sharkypedia-eoyemlau">游音流 - 鲨击百科</a></strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4055881&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610092698" alt="Etinjat" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4055881)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" >Etinjat</a></span></li> <li><em>只要在我的音击里，妳的命运最终都会落到我这拳头上。 ——游音流大师丝嘉丽，于1941年殴打古鲨．古拉时</em></li> </ul> </div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div> </div> </div> <br /></div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-17" style="display:none"> <p>1436:</p> <blockquote> <p>- 类似圣诞题材已经不少了，这个并没有写出新意<br /> - 在我看来圣诞雪橇和用小孩复活还有鹅是完全不相干的三件事，用马桶理论来说，就是把雪橇换成会飞的马桶，这个异常故事也能成立<br /> - 零星几处逻辑问题和中间的记录转折很生硬</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>&gt; 需要引以为戒的是以上问题实际上是我文里的普遍问题，我还没能在思想方面摆脱他们。今后仍需努力。</p> </blockquote> <p>1546：</p> <blockquote> <p>你但凡加个附录我都不会-</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>欣赏不来。</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>连源代码都翻了依然不明觉厉</p> </blockquote> <p>1374：</p> <blockquote> <p>推的太多了，d了</p> </blockquote> <p>400：</p> <blockquote> <p>没有亮点，令读者读不下去，节奏稀烂，用大段附录在scp里写故事这种形式过于不行，没有必要</p> </blockquote> <p>1184：</p> <blockquote> <p>节奏稀烂，从一个跳到另一个实在是莫名其妙。上一秒基金会还打算隐瞒信息让云民和虫子相互制衡，下一秒云民就决定和虫子集体自灭，完全没有道理。给人的观感一言难尽。</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>同上，作者应该是难以掌握长篇节奏。</p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kcorena" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3396110&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610092698" alt="Kcorena" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3396110)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kcorena" >Kcorena</a></span></p> 
